# seedlift-40: packedBound's complete-route cache after an opening at a covered seed (ctest
# legion_verify_seedlift, under TAK_LEGION_VERIFY). seedcorpse-army with 40 bodies: a 1 x 1 feature lands
# next to the click cell at tick 300, the route built after it holds estimate 0 at that illegal seed
# (startField does not test a seed's legality) and is never closed; the feature goes at tick 1000, an
# opening only. A cache dropped on closures alone kept the old bound (verify abort at tick 1069).
# Kept out of tools/scenarios/*.scn, the baselined gate set.
scn 1
name seedlift-40
ticks 1400
seed 7
players 2
team 1 0
weapons off
uplink 16
probe scale
map flat 1024 1024
type m mover 2 2500 10 3.2
group A 0 m 40 rect 300 500 330 518 pitch=3
churn 60 60 2 2 every=7 walk=3,0,30 toggle
churn 650 510 1 1 every=700 from=300 toggle
at 20 move A 650 511
